# ── Large runtime data files ───────────────────────────────────────────────────
# *.pt and *.pkl are intentionally NOT excluded here — they are downloaded by
# the CI smoke-test job, cached via actions/cache, and restored into the build
# context before `docker buildx build` runs, so COPY . . picks them up and
# bakes them into the image. If you are building locally without those files
# present the build will still succeed but the container will download them at
# first start via gdown (the fallback in main.py is still in place).

# ── Dev / local artefacts ──────────────────────────────────────────────────────
Downloads/
.DS_Store
__pycache__/
*.pyc
*.pyo
.Python

# ── Virtual environments ───────────────────────────────────────────────────────
.venv/
venv/
env/

# ── CI / git ───────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────
.git/
.github/
.gitignore

# ── Docs / internal only ──────────────────────────────────────────────────────
EASI_storage_S3bucket.md
EASI_EMUSE_K8s.md
EASI_storage_S3bucket.pdf
EASI_EMUSE_K8s.pdf
csa-easi-astro-flux-admin/

# ── Dev container ─────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────
.devcontainer/

# ── Ruff / Bandit caches ───────────────────────────────────────────────────────
.ruff_cache/
.bandit/
